WEBVTT

00:06:27.622 --> 00:06:31.650
by 3.7 trillion dollars.

00:06:31.650 --> 00:06:35.105
That's three times, in fact
that's more than three times,

00:06:35.105 --> 00:06:39.917
the total physical stock of dollar notes in circulation.

00:06:39.917 --> 00:06:44.165
Three times!

00:06:44.165 --> 00:06:46.075
Before the crisis,

00:06:46.075 --> 00:06:51.023
this would have been utterly unthinkable,

00:06:51.023 --> 00:06:58.487
yet it was accepted remarkably quickly.

00:06:58.487 --> 00:07:00.514
The price of gold,